om the ritual they performed in  episode 2 she's going to have to kill  her so she calls her friend roy who owns  a gun and heads back to the witch's den  there she finds her ex has been turned  into a zombie and is being used as  blackmail borrow says she can revive him  if lisa agrees to let her in her body  but things don't go as planned and roy  is beheaded it's a sad ending for him  since just last episode he told lisa  that for the first time in his life he  wants to be alive she makes him want to  live ever since he accidentally killed  his sister in a car accident one in  which he survived unscathed he's  performed death-defying feats to get  closer to death like skydiving for  example he says to lisa you know i die  in all my movies  nobody ever notices that now he'll die  in real life lisa manages to escape and  cries next to the skeleton of a wolf we  saw a group of cats eating it in episode  one but now all that's left is bone much  like lisa she has lost everything the  wolf has been used and discarded much  like many of the characters used each  other and tossed them aside once they  were done with them are you gonna tell  me you've never used anybody for the  sake of making something lisa used mary  boro used lisa lou used lisa it was a  terrible cycle of exploitation that ends  in tragedy for everyone even lisa at the  end of the series lisa gets her film  handed to her on a silver platter big  shot producer alvin sanders gives her  pretty much full control of her movie  but it's heavily implied she doesn't end  up taking it as she never responds to  alvin's voicemails and she leaves behind  her movie in these film canisters lisa's  apartment is now fully covered in vines  in fact it looks like it's turning more  and more into boro's place the spirit  linking the two is evidently still  thriving we see that boro has also taken  over mary's body her old body that of  jennifer has gotten too weak and now she  must take on another seeing as her  attempt to take over lisa's was  unsuccessful lisa books a flight to  brazil and the attendant asks her if  she's going there for vacation to which  she responds she's going home she's  likely heeding the call of the spirit  who asked her to come find her and her  mother's last known location as well as  that of the spirits was brazil notice  she is wearing cherry red lipstick like  the title of the show and also the  flavor of the soda from brazil boro  gives lisa an episode too we also see  the picture fade to white as she  ventures off and the show ends white was  also the color boro was said to have  seen when she sensed that lisa would be  her next body to inhabit white was also  the color of the jaguar i'm sure i  missed a bunch of stuff but i'm hoping  that covers some of the major question  marks of the series let me know what you  thought of brand new cherry flavor in  the comments below thanks for watching  everyone be sure to like and subscribe  and for more bad takes you can always  follow me on twitter and instagram at  thingstoryt until next time remember  daddy loves you very much

